     "body": "<p>Some process notes:</p>\n\n<p>Since we're not masochists, we won't craft our manifests by hand. bnd (or, in our case, bnd in its Maven plugin guise*) gives us a reasonably straightforward path to generate the required manifest entries. Sorting out the \"correct\" packages for export and import, writing an Activator for the bundle will require more effort.</p>\n\n<p>*Apache Felix Maven Bundle Plugin (BND): <a href=\"http://felix.apache.org/site/apache-felix-maven-bundle-plugin-bnd.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://felix.apache.org/site/apache-felix-maven-bundle-plugin-bnd.html</a></p>",
     "created": "22/Feb/10 10:29 PM",
     "id": "11244",
     "jsdPublic": true,
